sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User
  participant T as Tilda Loader
  participant R as React IIFE Bundle
  participant A as Auth
  participant N as Node-RED/SERV2
  participant M as MongoDB
  participant V as VivaCRM
  participant P as Payment

  rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
    U->>T: Open LK page
    T->>T: Load release.json
    T->>R: Load bundle.js / overlay bundle
    R->>A: Restore or request auth
    A-->>R: Access/refresh state
  end

  rect rgb(236, 253, 245)
    R->>N: GET games / support / communities
    N->>M: Query local LK state
    M-->>N: Documents/read models
    N-->>R: Normalized response
  end

  rect rgb(255, 247, 237)
    R->>V: Profile/bookings/subscriptions/group schedule
    V-->>R: Viva data
  end

  rect rgb(254, 242, 242)
    R->>N: Create/join/leave/payment operation
    N->>V: External booking/cancel/payment-related call
    N->>M: Persist local state/audit
    N-->>R: Result
  end

  rect rgb(245, 243, 255)
    U->>P: Payment page
    P-->>R: Return/callback marker
    R->>N: Confirm/reconcile payment
    N->>M: Update sale/payment state
  end
